     1,
     "<div dir=\"auto\">Hi,<div>I assume that you have the information about what timepoint each observation was made? Is that’s what’s in Ss$Y That’s the time vector you need to supply as “group” to make.A(), so I don’t think you need another $time vector? The code looks fine as it is.(provided that SS only contains the observed values, and not the missing observations)<br><br><div dir=\"ltr\">Finn</div></div></div>"
